---
import ResourcePageLayout from "../../../layouts/ResourcePageLayout.astro";
---

<ResourcePageLayout
  title="Bitcoin and your business"
  description="How your business can accept Bitcoin as payment. A practical guide for businesses."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="nav-buttons">
    <a href="/en/learn/lightning" class="nav-btn">The Lightning Network</a>
    <a href="/en/get-started/hardware-wallets" class="nav-btn">Hardware wallet</a>
    <a href="/en/get-started/bitcoin-storage" class="nav-btn">Bitcoin storage</a>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="feature-block">
      <div class="feature-image-small">
        <img
          src="/images/logos/btcmap.svg"
          alt="BTCmap logo"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <p>
          There are several things you can do to use Bitcoin to boost your
          business.
        </p>
        <p>
          The number of people using bitcoin as payment is steadily rising around
          the world. By offering your customers the option to pay with bitcoin,
          you'll stand out and become visible to a growing group of people who
          prefer to pay with an instant, cost-effective, and worldwide payment
          method — namely, bitcoin.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="feature-block reverse">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <p>
          By accepting bitcoin as payment, you gain increased visibility, no
          chargebacks, and — since only a very small share of your customers will
          likely choose this form of payment for now — the need to convert your
          bitcoin to local currency is probably quite small. A strategy that has
          proven very good for many over the years.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-image">
        <img
          src="/images/content/btcaccepted.png"
          alt="Bitcoin accepted here"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>See Bitcoin in practice</h2>
    <div class="video-grid">
      <div class="video-card">
        <div class="video-embed">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/PO2EsDytwjY"
            title="Bitcoin payment on Madeira"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="video-caption">
          Joe shows how several shops and others accept bitcoin as payment on the
          Portuguese island of Madeira.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="video-card">
        <div class="video-embed">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/s2vrtAGlG1Y"
            title="Bitcoin City in Arnhem, Netherlands"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="video-caption">
          Watch a video about Bitcoin City in Arnhem, Netherlands, where you can
          use bitcoin as payment in many places.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Get visible on BTCmap</h2>
    <p>
      On <a href="https://www.btcmap.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <strong>BTCmap</strong></a> you can list your business and make it easy to
      find for those who want to pay with bitcoin.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Lightning Wallets</h2>
    <p>
      There are many good
      <a href="/en/learn/lightning-wallets"><strong>Lightning Wallets</strong></a>, and
      you can see a list with a short description of the most well-regarded ones
      <a href="/en/learn/lightning-wallets">on this page</a>. All of them can be used to
      receive bitcoin as payment, and for many smaller businesses some of these
      will be sufficient.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you need a bit more — for your accounting, or the ability to manage
      different employees, locations, and payment terminals, and perhaps also
      accept bitcoin in a web shop — there are several good solutions for that too.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Payment solutions</h2>

    <div class="solution-card">
      <a href="https://swiss-bitcoin-pay.ch/?refCode=ENOGTYVE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="solution-image">
        <img
          src="/images/logos/swissbitcoinpay_w.png"
          alt="Swiss Bitcoin Pay"
        />
      </a>
      <div class="solution-text">
        <p>
          Swiss Bitcoin Pay is a service that makes it easy to receive payment via
          bitcoin, either on-chain, via Lightning, or both. You can be up and
          running right away, it's incredibly easy to set up, and it has good
          options for integrations and more.
        </p>
        <p>
          Use the discount code "<strong>enogtyve</strong>" for 0% fees for the
          first 3 months.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>
            <a href="https://swiss-bitcoin-pay.ch/?refCode=ENOGTYVE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Click here to go to Swiss Bitcoin Pay →
            </a>
          </strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="solution-card">
      <a href="https://app.paywithflash.com/signup?ref=837fa65af323b9b01dcbfccdb7d9f4e64d7a598daac25bbdf0fdc06e9d89bdd0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="solution-image">
        <img
          src="/images/logos/flash.png"
          alt="PaywithFlash"
        />
      </a>
      <div class="solution-text">
        <p>
          <strong>PaywithFlash</strong> offers several different solutions, including a super easy
          way to set up a simple web shop with bitcoin payments. They also have a
          long list of other solutions such as Point of Sale, payment links,
          invoicing, and more, as well as integrations with WooCommerce, Shopify,
          and others.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>
            <a href="https://app.paywithflash.com/signup?ref=837fa65af323b9b01dcbfccdb7d9f4e64d7a598daac25bbdf0fdc06e9d89bdd0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Click here to go to PaywithFlash →
            </a>
          </strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="solution-card">
      <a href="https://www.bitcoinize.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="solution-image">
        <img
          src="/images/logos/bitcoinize.png"
          alt="Bitcoinize"
        />
      </a>
      <div class="solution-text">
        <p>
          <strong>There are plenty of good solutions!</strong> Depending on what
          you want and how much help you need, there's something that works for
          your business.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Marketing</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>
        Make the most of accepting bitcoin as payment in your marketing. Make sure
        to get visible on
        <a href="https://www.btcmap.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          btcmap.org</a>, and show it in your business with a sign or stickers.
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      There are also several options for running campaigns, building customer
      loyalty, and more. Feel free to reach out to us if you're interested in a
      helping hand, or hop into the Telegram group
      <strong>
        <a href="http://telegram.enogtyve.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          telegram.enogtyve.org
        </a>
      </strong>
      to learn more.
    </p>
    <p class="cta-text">
      <strong>
        Need 1-on-1 help?
        <a href="mailto:kontakt@enogtyve.org">Send an email</a> with a short
        description of what you need help with, and we'll arrange a time and the
        details.
      </strong>
    </p>
  </section>

  <a href="#" class="back-to-top"> ↑ Back to top </a>
</ResourcePageLayout>

<style>
  /* Navigation buttons */
  .nav-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .nav-btn {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 150px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .nav-btn:hover {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Content sections */
  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm, 0.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
  }

  .content-section p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Feature blocks */
  .feature-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-block.reverse {
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
  }

  .feature-image img,
  .feature-image-small img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.15);
  }

  .feature-image-small img {
    max-width: 185px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Video grid */
  .video-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .video-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .video-embed {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%;
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .video-embed iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .video-caption {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Solution cards */
  .solution-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .solution-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.3);
  }

  .solution-image {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .solution-image img {
    max-width: 180px;
    max-height: 120px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .solution-text p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .solution-text p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* CTA text */
  .cta-text {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.06);
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.5);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 567px) {
    .nav-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .feature-block,
    .feature-block.reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .feature-image-small img {
      max-width: 140px;
    }

    .video-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .solution-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .solution-image img {
      max-width: 140px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
